    "abstract": "Location: Gallivan Center | 50 E 200 S, Salt Lake City, UT 84111\n\nPlease note that this is an off-site Sponsor-hosted Co-located event.\n\nSalt Lake City is about to have a moment. Pull up for DSS Day \u2014 starting with a lunchtime rave to get the community in one room before we get down to business. Full Send Sessions, live demos, zero fluff. The Receipts, straight from real customer deployments. Good food, better conversations, and a community that's actually building the future of PostgreSQL-compatible databases. \n\nTo learn more, please visit: https://events.ringcentral.com/events/distributed-sql-summit-salt-lake-city-2026/registration \nFor questions regarding this event, please contact: events@yugabyte.com",
