    "id": "1289883",
    "title": "Hub \u2192 Managed Cluster: How Long Did the Workload Take? Did It Arrive?",
    "title_raw": "Hub \u2192 Managed Cluster: How Long Did the Workload Take? Did It Arrive?",
    "abstract": "The OCM hub knows when it accepted a ManifestWork, but not how long the work took to land on each managed cluster, or whether it landed at all. In this talk I'll show how OCM v1.4 fills that gap. The hub logs T1, the work agent logs T2, and any observability tool can match the two on name and generation and compute the latency.",
